{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/87bc52d0a53a148bf92a7b3f8d6da8ad.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Inverted Tower is a dark fantasy CRPG inspired by\u00a0Fear and Hunger, Baldur's Gate, Shadowrun, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/d3ff59b40402ffa834d53c325cc553b5.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dream was given to all mankind, telling of a tower that would fall from the heavens above, and inside would lie a chalice. This chalice is said to grant its wielder one wish, any wish they could ever desire - but there's a catch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This chalice lies at the end of a cruel and unforgiving labyrinth inside of the Inverted Tower. Once you enter, you cannot leave, and no one knows how far the tower goes...\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Kristoff, 20-year-old farm hand and blacksmith who has left the safety of his exile to seek out this chalice and bring a cure to the disease plaguing his nation's land.\u00a0Alone or with the help of others you'll meet along the way, decisions made\u00a0will affect the lives of EVERYONE held captive in this twisted tower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/f92c130f1de80f2b059f6cd495861485.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE and UNIQUE\u00a0story paths and endings.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple party members and unique interactions for re-playability.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging functions in turn-based combat.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging bosses and enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885530?t=1767158744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885530?t=1767158744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/349a0968806ae8fdd860c86ebb2c583c7e3358c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767158744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/349a0968806ae8fdd860c86ebb2c583c7e3358c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767158744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes content such as blood/violence, brief nudity, light sexual themes, some language, and violence."},"demos":[{"appid":4089480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/87bc52d0a53a148bf92a7b3f8d6da8ad.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Inverted Tower is a dark fantasy CRPG inspired by\u00a0Fear and Hunger, Baldur's Gate, Shadowrun, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/d3ff59b40402ffa834d53c325cc553b5.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dream was given to all mankind, telling of a tower that would fall from the heavens above, and inside would lie a chalice. This chalice is said to grant its wielder one wish, any wish they could ever desire - but there's a catch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This chalice lies at the end of a cruel and unforgiving labyrinth inside of the Inverted Tower. Once you enter, you cannot leave, and no one knows how far the tower goes...\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Kristoff, 20-year-old farm hand and blacksmith who has left the safety of his exile to seek out this chalice and bring a cure to the disease plaguing his nation's land.\u00a0Alone or with the help of others you'll meet along the way, decisions made\u00a0will affect the lives of EVERYONE held captive in this twisted tower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885530/extras/f92c130f1de80f2b059f6cd495861485.avif?t=1767158744\" width=522 height=87 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE and UNIQUE\u00a0story paths and endings.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple party members and unique interactions for re-playability.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging functions in turn-based combat.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging bosses and enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["cmrn_"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_ima